<h2>Hi <%= @user.first_name.presence || "there" %>,</h2>

<p>We noticed your recent Parkour Utah subscription didn't auto-renew as expected. This was due to a technical issue on our end, not a card decline - your card was not charged, and you have not been billed for this renewal.</p>

<p><strong>To get things back on track, please visit <%= link_to "your account subscriptions page", account_url(tab: "subscriptions") %> and click "Update Billing Info" to save your card.</strong> That will restart your subscription and process the missed charge, so your student's access continues without a gap.</p>

<p>We are so sorry for the inconvenience - your student will not have their access interrupted while we sort this out. If you have any questions, please reply to this email and we'll be happy to help.</p>

<p>- The Parkour Utah team</p>
